Package: maplestats
Title: Client for the MapleStats MCP Server (Canadian Open Data)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Sanchez Pazmino", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "daniel@laboratoriolide.org")
Description: Searches and calls the tools of the hosted MapleStats MCP
    server, which serves Canadian open data from Statistics Canada, the
    Bank of Canada, CMHC, provincial agencies and city portals. Results
    come back as tibbles with their citation and provenance attached as
    attributes. Talks to the server's streamable HTTP endpoint directly.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://maplestats.danielstats.io/,
    https://github.com/dsanchezp18/maplestats-mcp
BugReports: https://github.com/dsanchezp18/maplestats-mcp/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    purrr (>= 1.0.0),
    rlang,
    stats,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
